(243946, 15878, 7067, '<td valign="top">Wow!  A stunning and sharp winter scene.  Nice lighting.  But doesn''t really convey "feeling blue" to me.  Great photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Wow!  A stunning and sharp winter scene.  Nice lighting.  But doesn''t really convey "feeling blue" to me.  Great photo nonetheless.', '2003-03-24 00:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(243953, 15960, 92, '<td valign="top">OMG ! LOL !!!!! Great !</td>', 'OMG ! LOL !!!!! Great !', '2003-03-24 00:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(243954, 15710, 4564, '<td valign="top">Superb!  A perfect photo.  10</td>', 'Superb!  A perfect photo.  10', '2003-03-24 00:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(243955, 15221, 6892, '<td valign="top">Yes they are bashful, especially when you chase them with a camera!</td>', 'Yes they are bashful, especially when you chase them with a camera!', '2003-03-24 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(243961, 15918, 4564, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I think you''re going to be asked this question a lot: wy is the 9 on the Roll in the photo???  Does your subject imply that you dare us to give it a 9/10?  Or is it a comment about a past rating you reeived?  Or is it just there to make us ask questions?  In any case, I find it extremely sad to see that 9 in there because otherwise your photo would truely merit a 9 or 10.  Unfortunately, the 9 bugs me so much in this photo, I can''t give it more than 7 (and I was tempted to lower it to 6).  On the other hand, extremely well taken photograph. Excellent dramatic lighting that support the emotion in the subject''s face.  Excellent cropping.  Excellent color.</td>', 'Hi.  I think you''re going to be asked this question a lot: wy is the 9 on the Roll in the photo???  Does your subject imply that you dare us to give it a 9/10?  Or is it a comment about a past rating you reeived?  Or is it just there to make us ask questions?  In any case, I find it extremely sad to see that 9 in there because otherwise your photo would truely merit a 9 or 10.  Unfortunately, the 9 bugs me so much in this photo, I can''t give it more than 7 (and I was tempted to lower it to 6).  On the other hand, extremely well taken photograph. Excellent dramatic lighting that support the emotion in the subject''s face.  Excellent cropping.  Excellent color.', '2003-03-24 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(243963, 15619, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very natural.  Good background, good lighting, devilish eyes.  A winner!</td>', 'Very natural.  Good background, good lighting, devilish eyes.  A winner!', '2003-03-24 00:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(243968, 15239, 6504, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel a little of my old friend, depression.  Very dramatic photo. Impacting</td>', 'Makes me feel a little of my old friend, depression.  Very dramatic photo. Impacting', '2003-03-24 00:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(243971, 15710, 6504, '<td valign="top">Great photo, a little splashing in it would add to it.  Sweet face,</td>', 'Great photo, a little splashing in it would add to it.  Sweet face,', '2003-03-24 00:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(243972, 15951, 7499, '<td valign="top">Notice the slim-fast in the background...</td>', 'Notice the slim-fast in the background...', '2003-03-24 00:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(243973, 15918, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good emotional photo.  What is the nine, though?</td>', 'Good emotional photo.  What is the nine, though?', '2003-03-24 00:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(243978, 15013, 92, '<td valign="top">God she''s beautiful !!!!!!!!</td>', 'God she''s beautiful !!!!!!!!', '2003-03-24 00:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(243979, 15505, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very timely, to turn a phrase. This photo strongly  reflects the gut reaction of many peace-loving Americans during this crisis. Good photojournalism.</td>', 'Very timely, to turn a phrase. This photo strongly  reflects the gut reaction of many peace-loving Americans during this crisis. Good photojournalism.', '2003-03-24 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(243980, 15909, 6504, '<td valign="top">This IS a lonely picture.  I think you did a good job with the foreground desolation leading to the isolated house.</td>', 'This IS a lonely picture.  I think you did a good job with the foreground desolation leading to the isolated house.', '2003-03-24 00:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(243983, 15914, 6504, '<td valign="top">Pretty, and a good idea.  A little soft on the focus or maybe that''s intentional</td>', 'Pretty, and a good idea.  A little soft on the focus or maybe that''s intentional', '2003-03-24 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(243985, 15824, 92, '<td valign="top">OMG how precious !!! The folded arms just add to that cute face ! This IS emotion !</td>', 'OMG how precious !!! The folded arms just add to that cute face ! This IS emotion !', '2003-03-24 00:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(243986, 15852, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oops.  What does this mean??  Very good photographically, but I have to admit, I don''t get it.  I still give it a good rating</td>', 'Oops.  What does this mean??  Very good photographically, but I have to admit, I don''t get it.  I still give it a good rating', '2003-03-24 00:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(243988, 15903, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very wonderful theme, and a good photo!!</td>', 'Very wonderful theme, and a good photo!!', '2003-03-24 00:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(243989, 15961, 6504, '<td valign="top">Pretty powerful!  Good clear photo.  A winner as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'Pretty powerful!  Good clear photo.  A winner as far as I''m concerned.', '2003-03-24 00:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(243991, 15938, 6504, '<td valign="top">The complexion is a little flat.  Kind of a scary photo.  But a creative idea.</td>', 'The complexion is a little flat.  Kind of a scary photo.  But a creative idea.', '2003-03-24 00:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(243994, 15654, 6504, '<td valign="top">Great!  You captured the snow really well which is difficult to do.  Cute little girl, sweet little hand holding on to the "chicken".</td>', 'Great!  You captured the snow really well which is difficult to do.  Cute little girl, sweet little hand holding on to the "chicken".', '2003-03-24 00:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(243995, 15710, 5007, '<td valign="top">Fun shot!</td>', 'Fun shot!', '2003-03-24 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(243997, 15453, 5007, '<td valign="top">I wish it were in better focus, but I like the composition and colors.</td>', 'I wish it were in better focus, but I like the composition and colors.', '2003-03-24 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(243998, 15792, 6892, '<td valign="top">How much closer can two be? Good illustration.</td>', 'How much closer can two be? Good illustration.', '2003-03-24 00:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(243999, 15969, 6504, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, that''s good.  And that''s not contrived!   Excellent.</td>', 'Ohhh, that''s good.  And that''s not contrived!   Excellent.', '2003-03-24 00:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(244000, 15387, 5007, '<td valign="top">Definately looks like a smile on his/her face.</td>', 'Definately looks like a smile on his/her face.', '2003-03-24 00:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(244001, 15969, 6892, '<td valign="top">Me Too!</td>', 'Me Too!', '2003-03-24 00:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(244002, 15614, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good acting, if it''s not for real.  Good photo</td>', 'Good acting, if it''s not for real.  Good photo', '2003-03-24 00:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(244004, 15792, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nicely done exposure (no pun intended) but I wish we could see her face.</td>', 'Nicely done exposure (no pun intended) but I wish we could see her face.', '2003-03-24 00:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(244005, 15690, 6504, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion, but it would be much better with a little more focus.</td>', 'I like the compostion, but it would be much better with a little more focus.', '2003-03-24 00:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(244007, 15813, 5007, '<td valign="top">I love the look on his face, he looks proud and full of strength as does his mother.</td>', 'I love the look on his face, he looks proud and full of strength as does his mother.', '2003-03-24 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(244008, 15724, 6504, '<td valign="top">Pretty, and a very good photo</td>', 'Pretty, and a very good photo', '2003-03-24 00:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(244010, 15031, 6504, '<td valign="top">VERY sweet.  Good clear photo</td>', 'VERY sweet.  Good clear photo', '2003-03-24 00:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(244012, 15981, 5007, '<td valign="top">I think I would have backed up to get all of the couple in the frame with more of the waterfall behind them. I have never done anything for 18 years!</td>', 'I think I would have backed up to get all of the couple in the frame with more of the waterfall behind them. I have never done anything for 18 years!', '2003-03-24 00:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(244013, 15654, 5007, '<td valign="top">NIce job of getting the exposure here. I have trouble with snow.</td>', 'NIce job of getting the exposure here. I have trouble with snow.', '2003-03-24 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(244016, 15813, 6892, '<td valign="top">Exceedingly wonderful shot. I can see both great love and pride for each other.</td>', 'Exceedingly wonderful shot. I can see both great love and pride for each other.', '2003-03-24 00:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(244017, 15723, 6504, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Now THAT"S comptempt.  I bet it came pretty naturally (at this age)<br/>Excellent photographically.</td>', 'Wow!  Now THAT"S comptempt.  I bet it came pretty naturally (at this age)Excellent photographically.', '2003-03-24 00:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(244018, 15901, 5007, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very original treatment. I love the diagonal lines and black and white treatment. Well done.</td>', 'Wow! Very original treatment. I love the diagonal lines and black and white treatment. Well done.', '2003-03-24 00:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(244019, 15889, 6892, '<td valign="top">Nice to see happiness during our times of strife.</td>', 'Nice to see happiness during our times of strife.', '2003-03-24 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(244020, 15824, 6504, '<td valign="top">A very familiar scene!  Very natural, and look at those sweet folded arms!  A winner.</td>', 'A very familiar scene!  Very natural, and look at those sweet folded arms!  A winner.', '2003-03-24 00:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(244022, 15972, 6504, '<td valign="top">MAGNIFICENT!!  A very high score from me.</td>', 'MAGNIFICENT!!  A very high score from me.', '2003-03-24 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(244023, 15900, 5007, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what the flag is doing. Is it over his mouth? I also wonder about the color, the flag is bright but everything else is faded.</td>', 'I don''t understand what the flag is doing. Is it over his mouth? I also wonder about the color, the flag is bright but everything else is faded.', '2003-03-24 00:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(244025, 15710, 6892, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a smile.</td>', 'Wow! What a smile.', '2003-03-24 00:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(244026, 15724, 5007, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I like the pose and lighting.</td>', 'Cool shot. I like the pose and lighting.', '2003-03-24 00:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(244027, 15330, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very sad.  You captured it well</td>', 'Very sad.  You captured it well', '2003-03-24 00:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(244028, 15560, 5007, '<td valign="top">Lots of us had this idea, it sure has touched us all.</td>', 'Lots of us had this idea, it sure has touched us all.', '2003-03-24 00:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(244029, 15645, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very tender photo.</td>', 'Very tender photo.', '2003-03-24 00:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(244030, 15508, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Did you know there is a way to correct "red eye" in animals in the photo editing?  Cute picture.</td>', 'Very nice.  Did you know there is a way to correct "red eye" in animals in the photo editing?  Cute picture.', '2003-03-24 00:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(244031, 15928, 5007, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like it that the couple and bench are almost black and the textures of all the other things.</td>', 'Well done. I like it that the couple and bench are almost black and the textures of all the other things.', '2003-03-24 00:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(244034, 15942, 5007, '<td valign="top">For me there is too much sky. Too bad the helicopter didn''t fly lower.</td>', 'For me there is too much sky. Too bad the helicopter didn''t fly lower.', '2003-03-24 00:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(244035, 15813, 6504, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photograph.  It is very impacting.</td>', 'What a wonderful photograph.  It is very impacting.', '2003-03-24 00:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(244036, 15861, 6892, '<td valign="top">Good black and white, lighting &amp; focus.</td>', 'Good black and white, lighting & focus.', '2003-03-24 01:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(244037, 15972, 5007, '<td valign="top">Sweet little dog and you captured a great look on her face in addition to a very busy tail.</td>', 'Sweet little dog and you captured a great look on her face in addition to a very busy tail.', '2003-03-24 01:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(244039, 15929, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very nice closeup, excellent focus... and a beautiful eye.</td>', 'Very nice closeup, excellent focus... and a beautiful eye.', '2003-03-24 01:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(244040, 15972, 6892, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition for an dog portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful composition for an dog portrait.', '2003-03-24 01:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(244041, 15967, 5007, '<td valign="top">Usually I don''t like tilted photos but it works in this one. I also like the subtle colors.</td>', 'Usually I don''t like tilted photos but it works in this one. I also like the subtle colors.', '2003-03-24 01:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(244045, 15960, 5007, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2003-03-24 01:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(244046, 15767, 5007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Nice silouette shot.</td>', 'Beautiful! Nice silouette shot.', '2003-03-24 01:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(244050, 15780, 5007, '<td valign="top">How did you get the red colors in what appears to be black and white? I can see some color in the tree and a hint in their faces. Very interesting photo that keeps you looking around at the details.</td>', 'How did you get the red colors in what appears to be black and white? I can see some color in the tree and a hint in their faces. Very interesting photo that keeps you looking around at the details.', '2003-03-24 01:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(244055, 15673, 5007, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, lots of character on his face and obvious concentration. All the colors work together.</td>', 'Interesting photo, lots of character on his face and obvious concentration. All the colors work together.', '2003-03-24 01:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(244057, 15688, 5007, '<td valign="top">For my tatstes there is too much blank at the top of this photo. I do like the lighting on the face.</td>', 'For my tatstes there is too much blank at the top of this photo. I do like the lighting on the face.', '2003-03-24 01:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(244058, 15690, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the window framing the woman. Good job getting the headlines in focus.</td>', 'Nice composition with the window framing the woman. Good job getting the headlines in focus.', '2003-03-24 01:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(244059, 15690, 6892, '<td valign="top">Yes, she does seem puzzled. Its great that you were able to catch the headline so well: without it, the picture would have lost its significance.</td>', 'Yes, she does seem puzzled. Its great that you were able to catch the headline so well: without it, the picture would have lost its significance.', '2003-03-24 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(244060, 15003, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors and good job of focusing and framing this. Also, good job capturing apprehension. Have to give you a 10 on this!</td>', 'Nice bright colors and good job of focusing and framing this. Also, good job capturing apprehension. Have to give you a 10 on this!', '2003-03-24 01:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(244063, 15013, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a lovely young lady.</td>', 'Nice portrait of a lovely young lady.', '2003-03-24 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(244064, 15890, 5007, '<td valign="top">Good job of lighting and framing this clown.</td>', 'Good job of lighting and framing this clown.', '2003-03-24 01:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(244066, 15878, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and brrrrrr!</td>', 'Very pretty and brrrrrr!', '2003-03-24 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(244067, 15852, 5007, '<td valign="top">I amnot sure I understand this photo''s message.</td>', 'I amnot sure I understand this photo''s message.', '2003-03-24 01:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(244069, 15040, 5007, '<td valign="top">A good job of lighting, focus and framing. The only problem I have is that the subjects are discordant to one another. Babies and appliances don''t ... well...  mix.</td>', 'A good job of lighting, focus and framing. The only problem I have is that the subjects are discordant to one another. Babies and appliances don''t ... well...  mix.', '2003-03-24 01:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(244071, 15964, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice picture with lots of color. He has a nice natural look on his face which makes this believable.</td>', 'Nice picture with lots of color. He has a nice natural look on his face which makes this believable.', '2003-03-24 01:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(244073, 15969, 5007, '<td valign="top">I wish you had gotten all the baby in the photo as I think you got a good expression (well not a happy one, realistic anyway).</td>', 'I wish you had gotten all the baby in the photo as I think you got a good expression (well not a happy one, realistic anyway).', '2003-03-24 01:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(244075, 15909, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like a little less sky but this is a nice shot.</td>', 'I like a little less sky but this is a nice shot.', '2003-03-24 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(244077, 15688, 6892, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it amazing how the right contrast can bring out the few simple details that reveal the emotion? I love the lighting in this photograph.</td>', 'Isn''t it amazing how the right contrast can bring out the few simple details that reveal the emotion? I love the lighting in this photograph.', '2003-03-24 01:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(244078, 15961, 5007, '<td valign="top">Without the rest of the animals nose, this doesn''t look right. The focus is not good on the eyes and seems to be on the fur between and in front of the eyes. Nice color.</td>', 'Without the rest of the animals nose, this doesn''t look right. The focus is not good on the eyes and seems to be on the fur between and in front of the eyes. Nice color.', '2003-03-24 01:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(244080, 15844, 5007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and model. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and model. Well done.', '2003-03-24 01:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(244081, 15951, 6892, '<td valign="top">Oh my! Caught in the act. This photograph clearly reveals the seductive properties of chocolate.</td>', 'Oh my! Caught in the act. This photograph clearly reveals the seductive properties of chocolate.', '2003-03-24 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(244111, 15013, 5865, '<td valign="top">A really beautiful little girl.  I like the lighting on her face and the way the wind is blowing her hair across it. The background is blurred nicely.  The particular emotion that you are portraying is not clear to me, but that might be because I have no children.</td>', 'A really beautiful little girl.  I like the lighting on her face and the way the wind is blowing her hair across it. The background is blurred nicely.  The particular emotion that you are portraying is not clear to me, but that might be because I have no children.', '2003-03-24 03:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(244112, 15654, 5865, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea and the girl is very pretty.  The light is so strong that it is casting rather ugly shadows onto the girl''s face.  The photograph might be improved by using fill flash.  Nevertheless I like the idea.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea and the girl is very pretty.  The light is so strong that it is casting rather ugly shadows onto the girl''s face.  The photograph might be improved by using fill flash.  Nevertheless I like the idea.', '2003-03-24 03:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(244113, 15928, 5865, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind the photograph and the way the couple are off-centre.  The railings and  buildings in the background make the shot a little too busy for me, but still a nice photograph.</td>', 'I like the idea behind the photograph and the way the couple are off-centre.  The railings and  buildings in the background make the shot a little too busy for me, but still a nice photograph.', '2003-03-24 03:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(244114, 15909, 5865, '<td valign="top">This is the most original idea I have seen on this particular challenge so I will score high for that.  Personally I think that there is too much foreground.  I think the image would be improved if the shot was cropped midway down the rocks, this would have placed the horizon along the bottom horizonal third  (but that is just my opinion).</td>', 'This is the most original idea I have seen on this particular challenge so I will score high for that.  Personally I think that there is too much foreground.  I think the image would be improved if the shot was cropped midway down the rocks, this would have placed the horizon along the bottom horizonal third  (but that is just my opinion).', '2003-03-24 03:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(244116, 15690, 5865, '<td valign="top">It is a good idea, but the woman looks out of focus to me and the shot is somehow spoiled.</td>', 'It is a good idea, but the woman looks out of focus to me and the shot is somehow spoiled.', '2003-03-24 03:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
