(244567, 15668, 4007, '<td valign="top">well first off I''ll say that a triptych on a single exposure with this level of clarity and precision is highly impressive.  However, all three of these frames seem somehow forced or unnatural.  So you get big points for innovation, but not many for impact and effectiveness. 6</td>', 'well first off I''ll say that a triptych on a single exposure with this level of clarity and precision is highly impressive.  However, all three of these frames seem somehow forced or unnatural.  So you get big points for innovation, but not many for impact and effectiveness. 6', '2003-03-24 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
