(244835, 15767, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t see emotion here.  Nice silhouette though</td>', 'I don''t see emotion here.  Nice silhouette though', '2003-03-24 15:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(244844, 15961, 4007, '<td valign="top">The focus on this shot misdirects my attention to the fur in the center of the shot, which is rather uninteresting, while the eyes toward the edges are left slightly out of focus.  If that is because of your auto focus, you should lock the autofocus with one of the eyes in the middle of the frame, and then while keeping the focus locked move the camera so that the eyes are along the sides again.  This shot also doesn''t seem to really convey any emotion to me except for the title.  I have no emotional responce to it.  I''d also recommend a wider crop, since currently I can''t really tell what this animal is, or at least use a different crop so that unidentifiable fur doesn''t dominate the shot.  Hope that helps.  Good luck. 3</td>', 'The focus on this shot misdirects my attention to the fur in the center of the shot, which is rather uninteresting, while the eyes toward the edges are left slightly out of focus.  If that is because of your auto focus, you should lock the autofocus with one of the eyes in the middle of the frame, and then while keeping the focus locked move the camera so that the eyes are along the sides again.  This shot also doesn''t seem to really convey any emotion to me except for the title.  I have no emotional responce to it.  I''d also recommend a wider crop, since currently I can''t really tell what this animal is, or at least use a different crop so that unidentifiable fur doesn''t dominate the shot.  Hope that helps.  Good luck. 3', '2003-03-24 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(244851, 15951, 4007, '<td valign="top">The framing is good.  The refridgerator in the background doesn\''t seem to add much but it also doesn\''t seem to take away from the shot either.  This shot has some surface level amusement value, but in terms of artistic consideration I\''m not impressed.  It doesn\''t strike me as particularly creative or unique, but it does come across as a little distasteful and rather mindless.  I wouldn''t say it conveys emotion effectively either.  I guess the whole concept just doesn\''t appeal to me, although execution isn\''t bad. 3</td>', 'The framing is good.  The refridgerator in the background doesn\''t seem to add much but it also doesn\''t seem to take away from the shot either.  This shot has some surface level amusement value, but in terms of artistic consideration I\''m not impressed.  It doesn\''t strike me as particularly creative or unique, but it does come across as a little distasteful and rather mindless.  I wouldn''t say it conveys emotion effectively either.  I guess the whole concept just doesn\''t appeal to me, although execution isn\''t bad. 3', '2003-03-24 16:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(244853, 15560, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because of the variety of faces and people you''ve captured. I find myself wishing that sign in the center wasn''t there so that it would have an unbroken pattern of people, but of course it is needed in order to establish the context.  It certainly represents emotion and elicits emotion at the same time.  Excellent work. 8</td>', 'I like this shot because of the variety of faces and people you''ve captured. I find myself wishing that sign in the center wasn''t there so that it would have an unbroken pattern of people, but of course it is needed in order to establish the context.  It certainly represents emotion and elicits emotion at the same time.  Excellent work. 8', '2003-03-24 16:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(244861, 15901, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the clean, stark composition of this shot.  I like the way the lines go through the frame and I like the placement of the birds.  All and all I think this is a great shot, probably a 9.  But to be honest, I don''t think it fits the challenge.  The title connects it loosely (and somewhat humorously) to the theme of emotion, but this shot doesn''t express or elicit emotion in any genuine way, so I''m taking off for that.  Regardless of my score though, this is a great shot that I''ll probably add to my favorites after the voting.  Good luck. 5</td>', 'I like the clean, stark composition of this shot.  I like the way the lines go through the frame and I like the placement of the birds.  All and all I think this is a great shot, probably a 9.  But to be honest, I don''t think it fits the challenge.  The title connects it loosely (and somewhat humorously) to the theme of emotion, but this shot doesn''t express or elicit emotion in any genuine way, so I''m taking off for that.  Regardless of my score though, this is a great shot that I''ll probably add to my favorites after the voting.  Good luck. 5', '2003-03-24 16:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(244885, 15942, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of the white house and the flag flying above it, good color of the sky, but I think the helecopter flying above it is just too high.  Great photo though</td>', 'Lovely shot of the white house and the flag flying above it, good color of the sky, but I think the helecopter flying above it is just too high.  Great photo though', '2003-03-24 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
