(244930, 15729, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really shows the different story between two halves.  Great black and white photograph, great expressions on the faces, good focus and sharpness, good tones too.</td>', 'Really shows the different story between two halves.  Great black and white photograph, great expressions on the faces, good focus and sharpness, good tones too.', '2003-03-24 16:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
