(244947, 15729, 6349, '<td valign="top">great photojournalist photo!  If i could vote on member challenges I''d give you a 10</td>', 'great photojournalist photo!  If i could vote on member challenges I''d give you a 10', '2003-03-24 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
