(245029, 15723, 6100, '<td valign="top">Somehow this appears to me to be more like "suspicion" than contempt. However, it is well lit and a nice shot.</td>', 'Somehow this appears to me to be more like "suspicion" than contempt. However, it is well lit and a nice shot.', '2003-03-24 18:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(245036, 15619, 6100, '<td valign="top">What eyes! Lip looks kind of "setup" but I''ll take it for real. The lighting emphasizes the lip.</td>', 'What eyes! Lip looks kind of "setup" but I''ll take it for real. The lighting emphasizes the lip.', '2003-03-24 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(245041, 15865, 4007, '<td valign="top">It definately has a snapshot feel to it.  It seems to portray some emotion, but it doesn''t really have much impact.  This strikes me more as a humorous photo to pass around to friends and family than a work of art.</td>', 'It definately has a snapshot feel to it.  It seems to portray some emotion, but it doesn''t really have much impact.  This strikes me more as a humorous photo to pass around to friends and family than a work of art.', '2003-03-24 18:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(245043, 15780, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nicely done but I think the background items are distracting. Either get them more out of focus or reposition so you don''t have those items. A garbage can and a sign don''t help convey the feelings one has upon parting. Good idea and I like the way the colors have been handled to make it a partially colored b&amp;w picture.</td>', 'Nicely done but I think the background items are distracting. Either get them more out of focus or reposition so you don''t have those items. A garbage can and a sign don''t help convey the feelings one has upon parting. Good idea and I like the way the colors have been handled to make it a partially colored b&w picture.', '2003-03-24 18:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(245045, 15013, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait with smooth even light suitable for a young girl. The warm evening sun is beautiful on her skin. I''d like to know what emotion you were trying to convey with this. I can''t read her face so that I know what she''s feeling or what emotion you''re trying to show me.</td>', 'Nice portrait with smooth even light suitable for a young girl. The warm evening sun is beautiful on her skin. I''d like to know what emotion you were trying to convey with this. I can''t read her face so that I know what she''s feeling or what emotion you''re trying to show me.', '2003-03-24 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(245048, 15890, 4007, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly unique.  I don''t personally like the dead center placement of his head.  Perhaps moving him more to the right in the frame and leaving a bit more negative space on the left would improve the shot.  Overall does a pretty decent job of conveying emotion.  Using the eyes more might help as well.  Good luck. 5</td>', 'It''s certainly unique.  I don''t personally like the dead center placement of his head.  Perhaps moving him more to the right in the frame and leaving a bit more negative space on the left would improve the shot.  Overall does a pretty decent job of conveying emotion.  Using the eyes more might help as well.  Good luck. 5', '2003-03-24 18:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(245050, 15890, 6100, '<td valign="top">I wish the black background didn''t show so much noise. You''ve got a great shot here but the background distracts. Still, it''s well cropped, well lit, and does give me a sense of melancholy.</td>', 'I wish the black background didn''t show so much noise. You''ve got a great shot here but the background distracts. Still, it''s well cropped, well lit, and does give me a sense of melancholy.', '2003-03-24 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(245055, 15864, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way the hand works into the frame.  Leaving that space blank might work out better.  The shadowing of the eye seems off due to the fact that there isn''t a significant amount of shadowing on the rest of the face.  Maybe a different angle on your light source would work better.  I do like the placement of the face in the frame and the expression is decent.  I like the dark eyes as well.  Overall pretty good shot. 6</td>', 'I don''t like the way the hand works into the frame.  Leaving that space blank might work out better.  The shadowing of the eye seems off due to the fact that there isn''t a significant amount of shadowing on the rest of the face.  Maybe a different angle on your light source would work better.  I do like the placement of the face in the frame and the expression is decent.  I like the dark eyes as well.  Overall pretty good shot. 6', '2003-03-24 18:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(245063, 15981, 4007, '<td valign="top">The lens flare hurts.  I could be wrong, but this shot seems like it was forced into "rule of thirds" subject placement, and I''m not sure if that works out best.  We don''t really see enough of the waterfall to make it an interesting element in the photo, yet the couple are shoved into the corner of the shot.  I think a horizontal shot of this might have been more effective, showing the couple on the right side of the frame and the background unfolding on the left side.  That way you could show more of the falls and the background could be a stronger element in the shot.  It is a nice candid that portrays real life emotion as opposed to staged emotion by models, which I like.  Good luck to you. 5</td>', 'The lens flare hurts.  I could be wrong, but this shot seems like it was forced into "rule of thirds" subject placement, and I''m not sure if that works out best.  We don''t really see enough of the waterfall to make it an interesting element in the photo, yet the couple are shoved into the corner of the shot.  I think a horizontal shot of this might have been more effective, showing the couple on the right side of the frame and the background unfolding on the left side.  That way you could show more of the falls and the background could be a stronger element in the shot.  It is a nice candid that portrays real life emotion as opposed to staged emotion by models, which I like.  Good luck to you. 5', '2003-03-24 18:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(245067, 15904, 4007, '<td valign="top">The colors throw me off here.  Is the redness just irritation or is it something else?  It seems to come across too strongly.  The shot, especially the top of the frame, seems overly dark as well.  I do like the eye itself though, or rather the eyelid and eyelashes.  It seems to me that this is one of those shots that either needs to be closer or farther away to be effective.  A closer zoom or crop just on the eye might work well, but pulling back to reveal more of the face and providing more context might also work well.  Good luck. 4</td>', 'The colors throw me off here.  Is the redness just irritation or is it something else?  It seems to come across too strongly.  The shot, especially the top of the frame, seems overly dark as well.  I do like the eye itself though, or rather the eyelid and eyelashes.  It seems to me that this is one of those shots that either needs to be closer or farther away to be effective.  A closer zoom or crop just on the eye might work well, but pulling back to reveal more of the face and providing more context might also work well.  Good luck. 4', '2003-03-24 18:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(245069, 15013, 806, '<td valign="top">gorgeous portrait!</td>', 'gorgeous portrait!', '2003-03-24 18:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(245071, 15722, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m going to guess that this is a candid.  If not, then it''s an incredibly staged shot.  Anyway, I really like this shot, and I think it''s because of the strong element of realism it has.  The expression is clear and effective, but not overstated.  The background provides a context fitting to a young boy but does not draw away from the subject.  The entire shot creates a scene with all the complexity of real life but it is understood at first glance.  The framing and subject placement are perfectly effective as well.  I hope this shot does well.  10</td>', 'I''m going to guess that this is a candid.  If not, then it''s an incredibly staged shot.  Anyway, I really like this shot, and I think it''s because of the strong element of realism it has.  The expression is clear and effective, but not overstated.  The background provides a context fitting to a young boy but does not draw away from the subject.  The entire shot creates a scene with all the complexity of real life but it is understood at first glance.  The framing and subject placement are perfectly effective as well.  I hope this shot does well.  10', '2003-03-24 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(245074, 15197, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well titled, as those eyes really do seem to smile.  This shot needs a little better focus to add to that effect.  Also, cropping out the top of her hair makes overemphasizes her forehead, which isn''t an appealing effect.  I''m undecided about the left side crop as well.  A little more work and this could be a very good shot.  4</td>', 'Well titled, as those eyes really do seem to smile.  This shot needs a little better focus to add to that effect.  Also, cropping out the top of her hair makes overemphasizes her forehead, which isn''t an appealing effect.  I''m undecided about the left side crop as well.  A little more work and this could be a very good shot.  4', '2003-03-24 18:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(245076, 15900, 4007, '<td valign="top">your biggest problem here is color.  The almost bluish pale skin tones of your subject make him look like a ghost, especially in contrast to the rather colorful background.  Maybe going b&amp;w on this shot would have been a good idea.  Otherwise the shot is effective and well done. 5</td>', 'your biggest problem here is color.  The almost bluish pale skin tones of your subject make him look like a ghost, especially in contrast to the rather colorful background.  Maybe going b&w on this shot would have been a good idea.  Otherwise the shot is effective and well done. 5', '2003-03-24 18:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(245107, 15453, 7514, '<td valign="top">Wow, this was beautifully done.  I love how some of the red is still in focus.  Brilliant.</td>', 'Wow, this was beautifully done.  I love how some of the red is still in focus.  Brilliant.', '2003-03-24 19:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(245111, 15645, 7514, '<td valign="top">This photo is amazing.  She looks as though the her dispair has led her to believe that nothing else in the world matters.  Well done, you captured that feeling well.</td>', 'This photo is amazing.  She looks as though the her dispair has led her to believe that nothing else in the world matters.  Well done, you captured that feeling well.', '2003-03-24 19:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(245112, 15852, 7010, '<td valign="top">Still...a nice shot!</td>', 'Still...a nice shot!', '2003-03-24 19:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(245154, 15339, 5826, '<td valign="top">Being A Christian I Love your Shot.  Keep up the good work &amp; I hope you aren''t getting knocked for it.</td>', 'Being A Christian I Love your Shot.  Keep up the good work & I hope you aren''t getting knocked for it.', '2003-03-24 20:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(245159, 15690, 5826, '<td valign="top">Good Eye.  Way to notice your surroundings.</td>', 'Good Eye.  Way to notice your surroundings.', '2003-03-24 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(245165, 15780, 4007, '<td valign="top">The dark tone works well I think.  The emotion here is effective.  I wish that sign at the top weren''t there because it breaks the grey tones throughout the shot.  Good solid shot.  7</td>', 'The dark tone works well I think.  The emotion here is effective.  I wish that sign at the top weren''t there because it breaks the grey tones throughout the shot.  Good solid shot.  7', '2003-03-24 20:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(245170, 15729, 5826, '<td valign="top">Wow I love this shot.  You caught the perfect "does''t know a thing about war" kid.  You got a 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow I love this shot.  You caught the perfect "does''t know a thing about war" kid.  You got a 10 from me.', '2003-03-24 20:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(245176, 15969, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the framing, the detail is great and the expression is wonderful.  I like the b&amp;w as well.  It''d be better without the shadowing in the background, but that''s a minor complaint.  This is a great example of how kid shots can be art if they''re done well.  Beautiful work. 9</td>', 'I like the framing, the detail is great and the expression is wonderful.  I like the b&w as well.  It''d be better without the shadowing in the background, but that''s a minor complaint.  This is a great example of how kid shots can be art if they''re done well.  Beautiful work. 9', '2003-03-24 20:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(245178, 15690, 6532, '<td valign="top">the wall to the right seems more in focus than the lady.  is it me?</td>', 'the wall to the right seems more in focus than the lady.  is it me?', '2003-03-24 20:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(245182, 15903, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the buds on each side of the flower.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the buds on each side of the flower.', '2003-03-24 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(245187, 15824, 5266, '<td valign="top">That is one HUGE pout!!!  Great expression - hope she''s happier now.</td>', 'That is one HUGE pout!!!  Great expression - hope she''s happier now.', '2003-03-24 20:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(245189, 15330, 5266, '<td valign="top">Oh, my, that is sad.  You get top marks - this certainly created an emotion in me!!</td>', 'Oh, my, that is sad.  You get top marks - this certainly created an emotion in me!!', '2003-03-24 20:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(245191, 15929, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot needed a better setup.  The blue line in the bottom left could have been avoided and the shadowing on the right side kills the photo.  That''s really too bad because you''ve got a really sharp focus on the eye and better lighting would have revealed a great eye shot.  This shot also seems to lack any specific emotional expression, but I do see the tie in that you''re going for here.  Good luck to you. 4</td>', 'This shot needed a better setup.  The blue line in the bottom left could have been avoided and the shadowing on the right side kills the photo.  That''s really too bad because you''ve got a really sharp focus on the eye and better lighting would have revealed a great eye shot.  This shot also seems to lack any specific emotional expression, but I do see the tie in that you''re going for here.  Good luck to you. 4', '2003-03-24 20:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(245196, 15833, 4007, '<td valign="top">You can slant your camera but its still just a shot of a tv screen.  You haven''t done anything significant enough to make this your own unique work or to make it an impressive or effective photograph.  Best of luck. 2</td>', 'You can slant your camera but its still just a shot of a tv screen.  You haven''t done anything significant enough to make this your own unique work or to make it an impressive or effective photograph.  Best of luck. 2', '2003-03-24 20:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(245197, 15453, 5266, '<td valign="top">Oh, it''s that nightmare revisited!!  You have done a great job on this.  Love the red against the black and flesh.  I know it''s soft in focus, but I really feel it works here.  9</td>', 'Oh, it''s that nightmare revisited!!  You have done a great job on this.  Love the red against the black and flesh.  I know it''s soft in focus, but I really feel it works here.  9', '2003-03-24 20:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(245199, 15716, 5266, '<td valign="top">OK - are you a guy?  Please!!!  LOL!!!  More likely she''s saying "That''s all???"<br/>Good expression.  I like the b&amp;w</td>', 'OK - are you a guy?  Please!!!  LOL!!!  More likely she''s saying "That''s all???"Good expression.  I like the b&w', '2003-03-24 20:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(245200, 15824, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and the subject. Maybe a little more contrast or levels, but you''ve got my vote.</td>', 'I like the crop and the subject. Maybe a little more contrast or levels, but you''ve got my vote.', '2003-03-24 20:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(245203, 15390, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the dof and composition.</td>', 'I like the dof and composition.', '2003-03-24 20:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(245204, 15890, 4388, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2003-03-24 20:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(245205, 15611, 5266, '<td valign="top">I agree!!  A bit dark for my liking.  I assume it''s taken in an aquarium?  Lots of gunk in the water detracts from the image.  Try out swimming with them sometime for real awe.</td>', 'I agree!!  A bit dark for my liking.  I assume it''s taken in an aquarium?  Lots of gunk in the water detracts from the image.  Try out swimming with them sometime for real awe.', '2003-03-24 20:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(245206, 15688, 4007, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little overboard on the negative space, but I stress the word little because I like the effect you''ve created.The lighting works great.  This is a great example of how a photo that already contains emotion is enhanced greatly by a good title.  The title really puts the icing on the cake here.  Great work. 9</td>', 'Maybe a little overboard on the negative space, but I stress the word little because I like the effect you''ve created.The lighting works great.  This is a great example of how a photo that already contains emotion is enhanced greatly by a good title.  The title really puts the icing on the cake here.  Great work. 9', '2003-03-24 20:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(245210, 15865, 5266, '<td valign="top">I hope you''ve recovered!! LOL!!  cute puppy - bet your ear still tickles.</td>', 'I hope you''ve recovered!! LOL!!  cute puppy - bet your ear still tickles.', '2003-03-24 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(245213, 15453, 4388, '<td valign="top">it would look more like the person was falling if the red material was not sticking out to the side. i like the originality!</td>', 'it would look more like the person was falling if the red material was not sticking out to the side. i like the originality!', '2003-03-24 20:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(245214, 15964, 5266, '<td valign="top">After this winter, I find it hard to see joy in snow, but I can understand how someone would enjoy it.  Great expression on the boy.  Hope he didn''t get too cold.</td>', 'After this winter, I find it hard to see joy in snow, but I can understand how someone would enjoy it.  Great expression on the boy.  Hope he didn''t get too cold.', '2003-03-24 20:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(245217, 15607, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but is a little dark.</td>', 'nice composition, but is a little dark.', '2003-03-24 20:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(245223, 15968, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice... the red/pink blurred colors in the background really give a great touch to this picture.</td>', 'Very nice... the red/pink blurred colors in the background really give a great touch to this picture.', '2003-03-24 20:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(245224, 15961, 5266, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the eyes in sharper focus.  The thing about this photo is that the title doesn''t seem to say what the tiger''s eyes are saying.  He looks tired and resigned to the life he is living - certainly not a wild free animal with no fear!!</td>', 'I would have liked to see the eyes in sharper focus.  The thing about this photo is that the title doesn''t seem to say what the tiger''s eyes are saying.  He looks tired and resigned to the life he is living - certainly not a wild free animal with no fear!!', '2003-03-24 20:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(245226, 15339, 4007, '<td valign="top">The DARE shirt is distracting.  A shirt without writing would have been preferable for a studio shot, unless this is supposed to be about drugs somehow.</td>', 'The DARE shirt is distracting.  A shirt without writing would have been preferable for a studio shot, unless this is supposed to be about drugs somehow.', '2003-03-24 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
