(245254, 15724, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent work -- certainl a contender!  Excellent work with the toning, and super job with focus and lighting.</td>', 'Excellent work -- certainl a contender!  Excellent work with the toning, and super job with focus and lighting.', '2003-03-24 21:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(245255, 15914, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really look like a bird.</td>', 'Doesn''t really look like a bird.', '2003-03-24 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(245258, 15453, 4007, '<td valign="top">Out of focus intentionally I know, but I don''t like the effect in this shot.  The shot just doesn''t have enough detail to it to be effective, especially as showing or eliciting emotion.  Perhaps for a falling effect it would have been better to place your subject towards the top of the frame and allow for negative space at the bottom.  Attempts at creativity are always appreciated, but I don''t think this one worked out particularly well. 4</td>', 'Out of focus intentionally I know, but I don''t like the effect in this shot.  The shot just doesn''t have enough detail to it to be effective, especially as showing or eliciting emotion.  Perhaps for a falling effect it would have been better to place your subject towards the top of the frame and allow for negative space at the bottom.  Attempts at creativity are always appreciated, but I don''t think this one worked out particularly well. 4', '2003-03-24 21:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(245259, 15722, 4494, '<td valign="top">Now that shows some emotion!  I can almost read his mind!  Good one.</td>', 'Now that shows some emotion!  I can almost read his mind!  Good one.', '2003-03-24 21:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(245260, 15792, 3102, '<td valign="top">Look out -- she''s gonna blow!  Nice work -- great sharpness, toning and composition.  Good luck to you if you happen to be the Father to Be :)</td>', 'Look out -- she''s gonna blow!  Nice work -- great sharpness, toning and composition.  Good luck to you if you happen to be the Father to Be :)', '2003-03-24 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(245261, 15852, 4494, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2003-03-24 21:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(245262, 15813, 3102, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait.  I''ll have to be honest in saying that this doesn''t seem to exemplify a particular emotion to me... but it''s certainly a wonderful shot nonetheless.  It also feels to me like it should be panned to the right just a teeny bit.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait.  I''ll have to be honest in saying that this doesn''t seem to exemplify a particular emotion to me... but it''s certainly a wonderful shot nonetheless.  It also feels to me like it should be panned to the right just a teeny bit.', '2003-03-24 21:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(245264, 15723, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well lit face!  Maybe should have made this a portrait shot.</td>', 'Well lit face!  Maybe should have made this a portrait shot.', '2003-03-24 21:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(245265, 15889, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done -- a good job on the composition.</td>', 'Nicely done -- a good job on the composition.', '2003-03-24 21:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(245268, 15197, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice expression, but it seems to lack a bit of sharpness.</td>', 'A nice expression, but it seems to lack a bit of sharpness.', '2003-03-24 21:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(245272, 15900, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what the emotion is here.</td>', 'Hard to tell what the emotion is here.', '2003-03-24 21:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(245273, 15967, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well first of all.... the angle of the picture is GREAT because it gives the feeling of the woman swinging the child around!   The lighting is OK but a little dark.</td>', 'Well first of all.... the angle of the picture is GREAT because it gives the feeling of the woman swinging the child around!   The lighting is OK but a little dark.', '2003-03-24 21:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(245274, 15767, 4007, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful shot, but it''s not a shot for an emotion challenge.  A silhouette of a church and a sky filled with clouds might be vaguely related to emotional experiences, but there doesn''t seem to be a solid connection to me. 4</td>', 'It''s a beautiful shot, but it''s not a shot for an emotion challenge.  A silhouette of a church and a sky filled with clouds might be vaguely related to emotional experiences, but there doesn''t seem to be a solid connection to me. 4', '2003-03-24 21:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(245275, 15668, 4494, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool.  How did you do this?  Says "with multiple flashes" but how did you get the pictures side-by-side like that?   The individual pics aren''t high quality but it''s still a great effect!</td>', 'That''s pretty cool.  How did you do this?  Says "with multiple flashes" but how did you get the pictures side-by-side like that?   The individual pics aren''t high quality but it''s still a great effect!', '2003-03-24 21:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
