(245298, 15813, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Is he a "challenged" person?  This really shows a lot pride and emotion in the mother AND the son!!  Great shot!  9.</td>', 'Great picture.  Is he a "challenged" person?  This really shows a lot pride and emotion in the mother AND the son!!  Great shot!  9.', '2003-03-24 21:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
