(245300, 15710, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, that''s so funny.  She''s having way too much fun in that mud puddle.  Great shot!  8.</td>', 'LOL, that''s so funny.  She''s having way too much fun in that mud puddle.  Great shot!  8.', '2003-03-24 21:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
