(245556, 15903, 4007, '<td valign="top">The title is all that ties this shot to the challenge.  This wasn''t a challenge for a flower shot.  That said, this shot needs a unique perspective or approach to get it to stand apart from every other generic flower shot.  It''s not a bad shot by any means, it''s just an extremely overused shot being used in a challenge it doesn''t relate to. Sorry for the harshness.  Best of luck to you. 2</td>', 'The title is all that ties this shot to the challenge.  This wasn''t a challenge for a flower shot.  That said, this shot needs a unique perspective or approach to get it to stand apart from every other generic flower shot.  It''s not a bad shot by any means, it''s just an extremely overused shot being used in a challenge it doesn''t relate to. Sorry for the harshness.  Best of luck to you. 2', '2003-03-25 01:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
