(246293, 15508, 4007, '<td valign="top">It''s an amusing capture, but it doesn''t really do much for me beyond that.  The focus in this shot, both literally and figuratively, is drawn to the dog, not the child.  The white eyed effect on the dog due to the flash detracts from the shot.  I would probably crop a bit tighter as well, since the surrounding background doesn''t seem to add to the shot.  The emotion demonstrated by the child toward the dog isn''t very effectively conveyed, partially because the child''s facial expression isn''t particularly distinctive, and partially because the dog dominates the photo, leaving the child''s actions and expressions not particularly clear.  The "kiss" that is captured here makes for a cute image, but I think in order to capture that kiss other elements of the photo suffered a lot.  Good luck. 3</td>', 'It''s an amusing capture, but it doesn''t really do much for me beyond that.  The focus in this shot, both literally and figuratively, is drawn to the dog, not the child.  The white eyed effect on the dog due to the flash detracts from the shot.  I would probably crop a bit tighter as well, since the surrounding background doesn''t seem to add to the shot.  The emotion demonstrated by the child toward the dog isn''t very effectively conveyed, partially because the child''s facial expression isn''t particularly distinctive, and partially because the dog dominates the photo, leaving the child''s actions and expressions not particularly clear.  The "kiss" that is captured here makes for a cute image, but I think in order to capture that kiss other elements of the photo suffered a lot.  Good luck. 3', '2003-03-25 20:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
