(247260, 15981, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good composition and pose. You could have stood to increase the contrast a little. You seem to have shot into the sun, so the picture has kind of a haze to it.</td>', 'Good composition and pose. You could have stood to increase the contrast a little. You seem to have shot into the sun, so the picture has kind of a haze to it.', '2003-03-27 09:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
