(416797, 15890, 10985, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just love theater and circus? They do it all for you: lighting, strong facial and often bodily expressions, colors, etc. Very compelling shot.</td>', 'Don''t you just love theater and circus? They do it all for you: lighting, strong facial and often bodily expressions, colors, etc. Very compelling shot.', '2003-09-12 11:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(471173, 15716, 13773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BigSmiles:</b></div><hr/><i>Is this in the scene where the killer runs after the girl, the girl stupidly runs upstairs and gets killed? We all gawk at how pretty her hair is and at how she''s wearing too much makeup... That being said, this much better than a LOT of other emotion pics.</i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by BigSmiles:Is this in the scene where the killer runs after the girl, the girl stupidly runs upstairs and gets killed? We all gawk at how pretty her hair is and at how she''s wearing too much makeup... That being said, this much better than a LOT of other emotion pics.', '2003-11-03 14:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
